  "description": "<p>This welcome mat features uplifting Christian messages and designs, creating a warm and spiritually enriching entryway for your home. It serves as a thoughtful gift for various occasions and is designed to reflect Christian values. This versatile doormat is suitable for both indoor and outdoor use, adding a personal and blessed touch to any space.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features faith-filled Christian designs and uplifting messages.</li>\n<li>Offers customization for a unique and personalized touch.</li>\n<li>Provides soft comfort underfoot with a durable non-woven fabric top.</li>\n<li>Equipped with a non-slip backing to keep floors clean and dry.</li>\n<li>Highly versatile for use in various indoor and outdoor settings.</li>\n<li>Easy to clean with simple washing instructions.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Multiple</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Washable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Bible</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>customized prayer mat with name</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Christian, Jesus, Bible</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Rubber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Hose or sponge clean with water and mild liquid soap; do not bleach; air dry</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This doormat is suitable for placement in various rooms such as the bedroom, bathroom, and living room. It is also ideal for use in front of the house, serving as a welcoming accent for both indoor and outdoor entryways.</p>",
